cover immediate join, held Start, expiry, pause at an attack cue, menu
wrap, reset and exit. Menu glyphs and station prompts share bounded,
persistent native text atlases, without per-frame texture uploads.

The native hidden smoke passed under Xvfb with the local actor, pose,
